      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "Syntax analysis is also clled parsing analysis\n- takes tokens produced by lexical analyser as input and geerates the parse tree\n- matching the paranthesis\n- checks each line by line of code and spots every tiny mistake\n- if code is error free then syntax analyser will generate the tree",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Syntax analysis is also clled parsing analysis\n- takes tokens produced by lexical analyser as input and geerates the parse tree\n- matching the paranthesis\n- checks each line by line of code and spots every tiny mistake\n- if code is error free then syntax analyser will generate the tree",
