      "text": "done with each phasig if any error is identified is reported and handled\n\nlexical error --> misspelling of identifier or keyword\n\nsyntax error --> arithematic expression with unbalanced parenthesis\n\nsemantic error --> incompatibla operand types\n\nlogical error --> infinite recursive call",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "done with each phasig if any error is identified is reported and handled\n\nlexical error --> misspelling of identifier or keyword\n\nsyntax error --> arithematic expression with unbalanced parenthesis\n\nsemantic error --> incompatibla operand types\n\nlogical error --> infinite recursive call",
