      "text": "Trivial approach --> print the error message when parsing cannot countinue and terminate\nPanic Mode Recovery-->\n    - the parser discards the input until it prints encounters a syncronising tokens\n    - these tokens are chosen so that the parser can make a fresh beggingig\n          examples --> C and java are ; and )",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Trivial approach --> print the error message when parsing cannot countinue and terminate\nPanic Mode Recovery-->\n    - the parser discards the input until it prints encounters a syncronising tokens\n    - these tokens are chosen so that the parser can make a fresh beggingig\n          examples --> C and java are ; and )",
